From: Noswad <64293615+TheNoswad@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] plugin: shannon, Samsung Shannon modems over SIT/cpif (local)

Pixel 6 (gs101, s5123): SIT port, modem, SIM, bearer, SMS and voice
classes, udev rule. Voice calls use VoLTE when enabled ([ims] in
shannon.conf): the plugin brings up the IMS PDN and the CP's AIMS stack and
drives calls through it; call audio routing on the phone side is left to
the sound stack (UCM + callaudiod + aoc-voiced). Local, not upstreamed.
---
